;:ASELECT (toggle);:A				;:AMOVE;:Aa-z0-9	Specified article		,	Next menu linex-y	Range x to y			/	Previous menu linex*	Same subject as x		SPACE	Next menu page (if any).	Current article			< >	Prev/Next menu page@ ~	Reverse/Undo all selections	^ $	First/Last menu page=regexp	Matching subjects;:ASHOW SELECTED ARTICLES;:ASPACE	Show selected articles (only when on last menu page)Z 	Show selected articles NOW, and return to this group afterwardsX	Show selected articles NOW, and continue with next group;:AGOTO OTHER GROUPS;:AX	If no articles are selected then skip to next group.N P 	Goto next/previous group WITHOUT reading current groupG	Goto named group or open a folder.B A	Go back/forward in groups already read;:AMISCELLANEOUS;:AQ	Quit nn				:help	More online helpU C	(Un)subscribe / Cancel		:man	Online manualF R M	Follow-up/Reply/Mail		L	Change menu layoutS O W	Save articles			!	Shell escape:unshar :decode :patch	Unpack articles